    <!-- Safety Instructions -->
    <string name="fire_instructions">FIRE SAFETY:\n\n• EVACUATE immediately via nearest exit.\n• DO NOT use elevators.\n• Assemble at the designated safe zone.\n• Call 911 if safe to do so.</string>
    <string name="medical_instructions">MEDICAL AID:\n\n• DO NOT move the victim unless necessary.\n• Provide basic first aid if trained.\n• Guide emergency responders to location.\n• Use AED if available.</string>
    <string name="security_instructions">LOCKDOWN:\n\n• RUN: If safe, evacuate the area.\n• HIDE: Lock doors, turn off lights, stay silent.\n• FIGHT: Only as a last resort for survival.</string>

